   "fix": "Export `theorem twoParticleCorrelation_of_card_le_one (h : Fintype.card \u03b9 \u2264 1) (n : \u2124) (\u03c6 : \u03b9 \u2192 AddCircle T) : twoParticleCorrelation n \u03c6 = 0` and use it for the first branch of `abs_twoParticleCorrelation_le_one`.",
